#: skills/workflows/qa-report-signing.bpmn:111
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Assemble the run record the signature will cover: the data hash and the process hash, each all-or-nothing. An UNKNOWN_HASH never reproduces another unknown, so a run that could not be hashed is signable only as what it is — unverifiable."
msgstr ""

